# Reference

- [Release](Release.md): components and version sources, compatibility surface, release checks and entry points.

This directory indexes supporting reference material for `<repo-name>`.

## Belongs Here

- the release reference: current release facts and mechanics
- supporting examples and reference notes
- implementation-facing documentation notes
- lookup material that supports the repository documentation model

## Does Not Belong Here

- current architecture descriptions: `../Architecture/`
- open design alternatives: `../Proposals/`
- decision records and rationale: `../Decisions/`
- migration rollout records: `../Migrations/`

## Use

Use this subtree for material readers look up: the release reference and
supporting notes that help readers apply the documentation structure.
